    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nina and her would-be friends in a quest to unveil the secrets of her Kingdom in this Turn-Based JRPG with Physics-Driven combat!. Battle enemies, overcome obstacles, upgrade your characters, and gather loot throughout your adventure! Aim, shoot and bounce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/1034e5da9fde99d24515e589b26bab1a.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=702 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/1034e5da9fde99d24515e589b26bab1a.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/1034e5da9fde99d24515e589b26bab1a.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/77d2221d552f6514d9de2d2f2c2bd2f7.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/75abb451752648f822095718173a4063.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/75abb451752648f822095718173a4063.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/75abb451752648f822095718173a4063.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on an adventure that will lead you through diverse landscapes to fight and solve challenges. Explore the vast kingdom of Triniad in the continent of Azulia. All the action unfolds on board-like arenas that reflect the local environments, where you'll face different types of enemies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/63c575ff38aafc7da558e9657cfc8648.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/6b93cf7685f295d3d29d0e92ebd16fb8.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/6b93cf7685f295d3d29d0e92ebd16fb8.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/6b93cf7685f295d3d29d0e92ebd16fb8.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You will engage your foes head-on. Employ your character's unique abilities strategically and position your party members accordingly to bend the outcome of the physics simulation in your favor to both; defend against incoming attacks and develop your own strategy effectively. Moreover, be aware of the enemies' weaknesses in their attributes and strategies. Exploit these vulnerabilities to turn the outcome in your favor, ensuring victory in this epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/c744b4af50fee7de386c3b5c8bca5938.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/3aec6dabcf7c896117e73c524d99875f.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=598 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/3aec6dabcf7c896117e73c524d99875f.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/3aec6dabcf7c896117e73c524d99875f.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Replay each stage as many times as you want to farm Eteriu Dust (experience), collect items, test strategies, and discover new victory conditions. You can also revisit that annoying Boss later to take it down in one shot! Use the Button Map to navigate the continent and find any previous stage you wish to return to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/720b223f3cec274105e2e86f4ac3ab41.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Play with a party of 4 main characters and build them as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Face your enemies using a physics simulation to strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Improve your characters' attributes and equipables to create an optimal build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Unfold the story-rich narrative of Eteriu, the magical crystal of Vridia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Replay any stage at any point to collect more experience and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Loot and craft better equipment for your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Experience the beautiful Great Soundtrack developed for Eteriu.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nina and her would-be friends in a quest to unveil the secrets of her Kingdom in this Turn-Based JRPG with Physics-Driven combat!. Battle enemies, overcome obstacles, upgrade your characters, and gather loot throughout your adventure! Aim, shoot and bounce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/1034e5da9fde99d24515e589b26bab1a.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=702 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/1034e5da9fde99d24515e589b26bab1a.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/1034e5da9fde99d24515e589b26bab1a.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/77d2221d552f6514d9de2d2f2c2bd2f7.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/75abb451752648f822095718173a4063.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/75abb451752648f822095718173a4063.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/75abb451752648f822095718173a4063.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on an adventure that will lead you through diverse landscapes to fight and solve challenges. Explore the vast kingdom of Triniad in the continent of Azulia. All the action unfolds on board-like arenas that reflect the local environments, where you'll face different types of enemies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/63c575ff38aafc7da558e9657cfc8648.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/6b93cf7685f295d3d29d0e92ebd16fb8.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/6b93cf7685f295d3d29d0e92ebd16fb8.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/6b93cf7685f295d3d29d0e92ebd16fb8.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You will engage your foes head-on. Employ your character's unique abilities strategically and position your party members accordingly to bend the outcome of the physics simulation in your favor to both; defend against incoming attacks and develop your own strategy effectively. Moreover, be aware of the enemies' weaknesses in their attributes and strategies. Exploit these vulnerabilities to turn the outcome in your favor, ensuring victory in this epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/c744b4af50fee7de386c3b5c8bca5938.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/3aec6dabcf7c896117e73c524d99875f.poster.avif?t=1738314977\" width=598 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/3aec6dabcf7c896117e73c524d99875f.webm?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/3aec6dabcf7c896117e73c524d99875f.mp4?t=1738314977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Replay each stage as many times as you want to farm Eteriu Dust (experience), collect items, test strategies, and discover new victory conditions. You can also revisit that annoying Boss later to take it down in one shot! Use the Button Map to navigate the continent and find any previous stage you wish to return to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/720b223f3cec274105e2e86f4ac3ab41.webp?t=1738314977\" width=206 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Play with a party of 4 main characters and build them as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Face your enemies using a physics simulation to strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Improve your characters' attributes and equipables to create an optimal build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Unfold the story-rich narrative of Eteriu, the magical crystal of Vridia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Replay any stage at any point to collect more experience and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Loot and craft better equipment for your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463930/extras/b0046f5762d65d456af6d827080c467f.webp?t=1738314977\" width=16 height=12 /></span> Experience the beautiful Great Soundtrack developed for Eteriu.</p>",
